  "pattern": "CAP-0040 added a signer type that carries a payload: the strkey starts with P and is longer than a G address (up to 165 characters for a 64-byte payload). Readers that assume every signer is a 32-byte ed25519 key truncate it or fail. wallet-backend halted ingestion on testnet ledger 4437357 (#729) and stored the signer as 33 bytes, losing the payload (#716).",
